---
layout: base.njk
title: Projects
permalink: /projects/
---

<h1>Projects</h1>
I've listed many of my extra-curricular and several of my professional projects below, organised by start year. Click through for details.

{% for group in collections.projects | groupByYear %}
  <h2>{{ group.year }}</h2>
  <ul class="project-list">
  {% for project in group.projects %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.title }}</a>
      {% if project.data.description %}<span class="project-desc"> - {{ project.data.description }}</span>{% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% endfor %}
